import forgelib as F
G = F.make(slug="the-forge-runes-guide", order=13, kw="runes in the forge",
 title="How to Use Runes in The Forge: Best Pickaxe Runes",
 h1="How to Equip and Use Runes in The Forge (Best Runes for Your Pickaxe)",
 desc="How to equip and use runes in The Forge: the Runemaker, rune slots, every Miner Shard trait for pickaxes, the best weapon runes and fast Island 3 mining.",
 kw2=["the forge runes","the forge best pickaxe runes","how to equip runes the forge","the forge miner shard","the forge runemaker"],
 related=["the-forge-pickaxe-progression","the-forge-forging-guide","the-forge-afk-farming","the-forge-island-3-guide"],
 ids=["zomSBP0a5-A","Uke5ESZ07Hc","d1TMm1cBdyY"],
 lead="Runes add extra traits to your gear. On a pickaxe, each Miner Shard can add up to 12% mining speed or 15% mine damage. Fridge has three Shorts on <strong>runes in The Forge</strong>: how to equip them, the best pickaxe runes, and the fastest mining setup for Island 3. Here they are with the current rune stats from the Forge Wiki.",
 heading="Watch Fridge's Rune Shorts",
 sections=[
 ("what","What Runes Do","""<p>Runes are items that add special traits to weapons, armor and pickaxes. They come in three groups, according to the Forge Wiki:</p>
<ul><li><strong>Pickaxe runes</strong> change mining speed, damage or luck.</li><li><strong>Weapon runes</strong> add damage effects such as freeze, poison, burn, explosions and lifesteal.</li><li><strong>Armor runes</strong> improve survivability or movement.</li></ul>
<p>Most runes drop from enemies. Each trait rolls inside a range, so two copies of the same rune can have different numbers.</p>"""),
 ("equip","How to Equip Runes","""<ol class="steps"><li>Get a rune by defeating enemies, for example Delver Zombies for Miner Shards.</li><li>Go to the <strong>Runemaker</strong> in any island hub. On Stonewake's Cross, he's at spawn across from the Enhancer.</li><li>Pick the item with an open <strong>rune slot</strong> and choose the rune to socket in.</li><li>Pay the fee. The Runemaker only attaches runes; he doesn't make them.</li></ol>
<p>Pickaxes come with rune slots already: 3 on most mid-game picks and 4 on the top Frostspire pickaxes. Weapons and armor unlock slots through <strong>enhancing</strong>. Pro Game Guides warns that a failed enhancement can lose a slot, and the rune in it, so finish enhancing before you add runes. Socketing a rune into a pickaxe is the most expensive kind, so only rune the pickaxe you'll keep using.</p>"""),
 ("pickaxe","Best Pickaxe Rune: Miner Shard","""<div class="table-wrap"><table><caption>Miner Shard traits (Forge Wiki)</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Trait</th><th scope="col">Range</th><th scope="col">Best for</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td>Luck</td><td>5–16% overall luck</td><td>Rare ores</td></tr><tr><td>Yield</td><td>5–15% chance of 1 extra ore</td><td>Bulk farming</td></tr><tr><td>Swift Mining</td><td>4–12% faster mining</td><td>Speed</td></tr><tr><td>Mine Power</td><td>8–15% extra mine damage</td><td>Breaking tough rocks</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p>Miner Shards drop from <strong>Delver Zombies</strong>, <strong>Bombers</strong> and the <strong>Golem</strong> boss. For the fastest Island 3 mining, which Fridge's December 28 Short covers, fill every slot with Miner Shards rolled for <strong>Swift Mining</strong> and <strong>Mine Power</strong>. Swap to Luck and Yield shards when you're farming rare ores.</p>"""),
 ("weapon","Top Weapon Runes","""<ul><li><strong>Drain Edge</strong> (from the Reaper): heals 4–28% of damage dealt, capped at 8% of max Health per hit. Pro Game Guides calls it the best rune on the Forgotten Kingdom.</li><li><strong>Frost Speck</strong> (spiders, Golem, Frostburn Oni): up to a 60% chance to freeze enemies for 3–5 seconds. It's the top Frostspire rune.</li><li><strong>Blast Chip</strong> (Bomber): on-hit explosions of 20–80% weapon damage.</li><li><strong>Venom Crumb</strong> (Blight Pyromancer): poison damage over time.</li><li><strong>Chill Dust</strong> (Golem): slows enemy attacks and movement.</li></ul>
<p>Pair your runes with the right pickaxe from our <a href="the-forge-pickaxe-progression.html">pickaxe progression guide</a>.</p>""")],
 faq=[("How do you equip runes in The Forge?","Take the rune and an item with an open rune slot to the Runemaker in any island hub, then pay to socket it."),
      ("What is the best pickaxe rune in The Forge?","Miner Shard. Roll it for Swift Mining and Mine Power for speed, or for Luck and Yield for rare ores."),
      ("Where do you get Miner Shards?","From Delver Zombies, Bombers and the Golem boss.")],
 sources=[F.wiki("Runes"),F.wiki("Runemaker"),F.wiki("Pickaxe","Pickaxes"),("Pro Game Guides: Runemaker and Enhancer tips","https://progameguides.com/roblox/the-forge-map-all-islands-locations-level-requirements/")],
 howto=("How to equip runes in The Forge",[("Get a rune","Defeat enemies that drop runes, such as Delver Zombies.","equip"),("Visit the Runemaker","Go to the Runemaker in your island hub.","equip"),("Socket it","Choose an item with an open slot and pick the rune.","equip")]))
